<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</headline>
<dateline>GHENT, Belgium 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>the second day of the Ghent six-day cycling race on Wednesday:</p>
<p> 1. Bruno Risi/Kurt Betschart (Switzerland)		  211</p>
<p>points</p>
<p> 2. Andreas Kappes/Carsten Wolf (Germany)		    154</p>
<p>1 lap behind</p>
<p> 3. Silvio Martinello/Marco Villa (Italy)		    155</p>
<p> 4. Etienne De Wilde/Adriano Baffi (Belgium/Italy)	 153</p>
<p> 5. Jens Veggerby/Jimmi Madsen (Denmark)		     148</p>
<p>2 laps</p>
<p>6. Matthew Gilmore/Jakob Piil Storm (Australia/Denmark) 103</p>
</text>
